# Keep markdown out of agent search, glob and file-suggestion results.
#
# A partial read of these is worse than no read: it yields confident, wrong
# conclusions about why the code is shaped the way it is. Open them deliberately,
# by name, when the owner points at one.
#
# `.ignore` is always respected, independently of `.gitignore` and of the
# `respectGitignore` setting. It governs search and discovery only; it does not
# block reading a known path. That needs `permissions.deny` rules.

*.md
